Restore the memory suite against the pinned native DMA and GPU contracts.

Use immediate DMA submission/completion queues instead of the removed DMAC pump,
D_STAT emulation and CPU rasterizer. Exercise real GSTextureStore uploads/CLUTs
without a GL context; compare decoded primitive state and vertices at submission.
Keep scratchpad completion and submission-count assertions: they expose real bugs
fixed by the following patches. No performance improvement claimed.

